Dithalion looks at the weapon and grows still, his eyes wide in wonderment.

'This is a relic of the Elder Days, my friend! Such a weapon has an unmatched potential to grow in power, its storied legend growing along with your own!'

<rgb=#00FF00>- Legendary Items can be enhanced in a number of ways as you adventure in Middle-earth:

- Their base stats will increase along with yours as you level.

- They can be slotted with a wide assortment of traceries, and those traceries can be further enhanced by runes.

